      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Audio sliders seem to be a common problem in audio software. Here's some posts with proposed solutions, but I'm not familiar enough with the topic to identify the exact issue in VRChat. Something something logarithmic.\nhttps://www.dr-lex.be/info-stuff/volumecontrols.html\nhttps://gamedevbeginner.com/the-right-way-to-make-a-volume-slider-in-unity-using-logarithmic-conversion/\nhttps://www.reddit.com/r/programming/comments/9n2y0/stop_making_linear_volume_controls/",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "6160d9409bd169702aabc46d",
      "author": {
